# Root .gitignore -- covers files that could land directly at the repo
# root (secrets, OS/IDE cruft). VTE/ and Aetheris Studio/ each have their
# own .gitignore for what's specific to those subprojects; this one is
# deliberately narrow, not a duplicate of either.

# Secrets -- never commit real credentials/tokens, even accidentally via
# `git add -A`/`git add .` from the repo root.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Claude Code / agent tooling working state, not part of the submission
.claude/
